{"id":"640499","name":"鬼菌肉丝香覃","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/640499/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鬼菌","amount":"500g"},{"name":"熟精肉","amount":"约120g"},{"name":"花生油","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"上次熬好的香覃","amount":"些许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"野生鬼菌。","img":"images/640499/step_1.jpeg"},{"step":2,"desc":"采回来。","img":"images/640499/step_2.jpeg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洗净，沥干水分。","img":"images/640499/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"熟肉拍碎。","img":"images/640499/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"撕成细丝，葱切丝。","img":"images/640499/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"大蒜切末。","img":"images/640499/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取前些天熬好的香覃。","img":"images/640499/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"热锅冷油。","img":"images/640499/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"油热放花椒八角和葱丝肉丝。","img":"images/640499/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"扒拉均匀放食盐。","img":"images/640499/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放白糖。","img":"images/640499/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"扒拉均匀。","img":"images/640499/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放蘑菇。","img":"images/640499/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"不停翻炒。","img":"images/640499/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"蘑菇炒软放蒜末。","img":"images/640499/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"再炒几分钟放生抽。","img":"images/640499/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"扒拉均匀后一直熬，把水分熬出来，记得不停翻拌。","img":"images/640499/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"熬至没有水分，放以前熬的香覃。","img":"images/640499/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"扒拉炒2分钟放芝麻。","img":"images/640499/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"关火扒拉均匀。","img":"images/640499/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"放凉。","img":"images/640499/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"装瓶即可。","img":"images/640499/step_22.jpg"}],"tips":"我做的香香的稍微有点辣味，喜欢吃辣的多放点干辣椒！ \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}